WEBVTT

00:12:27.868 --> 00:12:31.288
Invite the underdog in the front door;

00:12:31.288 --> 00:12:34.458
pay them to learn like it’s their job;

00:12:34.458 --> 00:12:36.752
and then build them castles
in their hometowns.

00:12:38.128 --> 00:12:39.671
It’s worked in Fresno,

00:12:39.671 --> 00:12:42.257
it’s working in Bakersfield
and Toledo, Ohio

00:12:42.257 --> 00:12:45.803
and it can work in underestimated
cities all over the world.

00:12:47.596 --> 00:12:49.723
Thank you so much for your attention.

00:12:49.723 --> 00:12:50.724
(Applause)